# Auto-generated reference pages are *committed* — they regenerate from
# the Python source on every `npm run dev` / `npm run build` via
# scripts/run_gen.sh, but we keep the last good output on disk so
# Vercel (which doesn't have mnexus's Python deps installed) always has
# a working reference even when the build-time regen would fail.
#
# When you edit a CLI flag, REPL slash command, or FastAPI endpoint:
#   1. `cd docs-site && npm run dev`   (or `bash scripts/run_gen.sh`)
#   2. `git add docs-site/content/reference`
#   3. Commit alongside your code change.

# Build artefacts
*.log
.DS_Store
.env*
